title: "AiEGIS — Substrate-Anchored AI Agent Identity"
abstract: "Open standard and reference implementation for cryptographically anchoring AI agent identity to the silicon they run on (TPM 2.0 / Apple Secure Enclave / Intel TDX / AMD SEV-SNP). Spec, Python SDK, and EU AI Act compliance bundle."
